{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33974","headline":"怀华阳润卿博士三首 二 · 皮日休","name":"怀华阳润卿博士三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冥心唯事白英君，不问人间爵与勳。\n林下醉眠仙鹿见，洞中闲话隐芝闻。\n石牀卧苦浑无藓，藤箧开稀恐有云。\n料得虚皇新诏样，青琼板上绿爲文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}